WEBVTT

00:03.720 --> 00:06.080
Your servant greets Your Majesty.

00:07.440 --> 00:09.560
Rise help me change clothes.

00:09.640 --> 00:11.040
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:11.600 --> 00:15.000
Your Majesty what kind of incense do you use?

00:15.080 --> 00:17.400
It's so fragrant, Your Majesty.

00:19.400 --> 00:25.080
Your Majesty I suddenly remembered there are still some things I haven't done what things?

00:26.640 --> 00:28.040
Your Majesty.

00:30.080 --> 00:31.600
Fan Zhong what is that?

00:31.680 --> 00:37.680
That is the eldest daughter of the great chieftain from Longzhou in the northwest who submitted if Your Majesty humiliates her like this I'm afraid Longxi will cause trouble again.

00:37.840 --> 00:39.880
Your Majesty please think twice.

00:56.000 --> 01:02.000
Your Majesty Your Majesty, you've returned Your Majesty as long as you close your eyes.

01:02.160 --> 01:05.800
I can still give you pleasure Your Majesty.

01:06.560 --> 01:09.280
Attend the bedchamber right away.

